<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alcoa, Reynolds Metals.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alcoa, Reynolds Metals.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber downgraded Aluminum Co of America to sell from neutral and Reynolds Metals Co to neutral from buy, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Reynolds ended Tuesday at 56-1/4 and Alcoa finished at 61-3/8.</p>
</text>
